# Generated: corpora, caches and evaluation artefacts. Rebuilt by the scripts
# in src/ — see the README. Never a source of truth.
out/*

# ...except the score floors. Not a build artefact but the record of which index
# the "I don't know" threshold describes. The API refuses to start without them,
# so committing them is what lets a fresh clone serve — and it makes a change to
# the floors show up in review as a diff rather than as a silent behaviour shift.
!out/score-floors.json
